{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this pulp-adventure roguelite, <strong>light is life</strong>. Your torch steadily burns down as you sprint through <strong>procedural</strong>, trap-laced temples in search of ancient artifacts. Doors seal behind you; survive each encounter, loot fast, and move before the darkness swallows you. Tight, readable combat works with <strong>keyboard/mouse or controller</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a cozy hub study, chart expeditions across biomes like the <strong>Buried Temple</strong> and <strong>Flooded Catacombs</strong>. A ruthless rival force\u2014<strong>black-ops commandos</strong> (soldiers, snipers, ninjas)\u2014races you to the prizes, while <strong>artifact-warped creatures</strong> (twisted golems and worse) prowl the ruins. Meanwhile, a fanatical cult known as the <strong>Order of the Eclipse</strong> seeks the relics for an apocalyptic ritual.<br>Core Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Torch = Health.</strong> Your torch drains over time; refuel or die. Managing radius, pathing, and timing is the heart of every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106620/extras/31a0aafa177f82406921ddd8d4fb3bb8.poster.avif?t=1770979295\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106620/extras/31a0aafa177f82406921ddd8d4fb3bb8.webm?t=1770979295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106620/extras/31a0aafa177f82406921ddd8d4fb3bb8.mp4?t=1770979295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Room-by-room combat.</strong> Enter a chamber, doors lock, defeat enemies, grab loot, move on\u2014focused, readable encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106620/extras/7f5464e802e246a40a171ff8fe401409.poster.avif?t=1770979295\" width=1170 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106620/extras/7f5464e802e246a40a171ff8fe401409.webm?t=1770979295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106620/extras/7f5464e802e246a40a171ff8fe401409.mp4?t=1770979295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural temples.</strong> Each temple layouts, hazards, and enemy compositions changes for fresh routing and tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106620/extras/e4a6b1ed37b506e5b2ba29d7fab17fef.poster.avif?t=1770979295\" width=1170 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106620/extras/e4a6b1ed37b506e5b2ba29d7fab17fef.webm?t=1770979295\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106620/extras/e4a6b1ed37b506e5b2ba29d7fab17fef.mp4?t=1770979295\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful upgrades.</strong> Between rooms/bosses, pick build-defining cards (gun mods, torch perks, mobility, defense, elements) with smart tagging so choices fit your current weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss arenas with clear reads.</strong> Set-piece fights emphasize positioning, line-of-sight, and pattern mastery. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106620?t=1770979295","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steams